      en: ["The summit reaches an elevation of 2,601 meters.", "It is located within the oldest national park in North Macedonia.", "The peak is geologically composed primarily of granite.", "It is a key habitat for the rare Molika pine tree.", "Two glacial lakes are situated just below the peak.", "The summit offers clear views of the Prespa Lake basin."],
      es: ["Altitud: 2601 m", "Cima más alta de las montañas Baba", "Parque nacional fundado en 1948", "Pino molika endémico (Pinus peuce) desde los 1200 m", "Compuesto por gneis y esquisto micáceo", "Importante cuenca hidrográfica para Pelagonia"],
      pt: ["Altitude: 2601 m", "Pico mais alto das montanhas Baba", "Parque nacional fundado em 1948", "Pinheiro molika endémico (Pinus peuce) a partir de 1200 m", "Composto por gnaisse e micaxisto", "Importante bacia hidrográfica para a Pelagónia"],
